{
  "type": "AdaptiveCard",
  "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
  "version": "1.5",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "How to use AISO",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "size": "Large",
      "wrap": true
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "New here? Follow the flow for your role, then use a shortcut or type a short command in English or Vietnamese (one language per message).",
      "wrap": true,
      "isSubtle": true,
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Employee flow (release request)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "1. Show your orders (list or open orders)\n2. Open **View details** on the order you own\n3. Tap **Request release** → confirm\n4. Wait for a Manager — status stays Open with **Approval: Waiting**\n5. Optional: **Reject** or **Forward** only on orders you own",
          "wrap": true,
          "spacing": "Small"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Manager flow (approve release)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "1. Open **Pending approvals**\n2. Review the order → **View details** if needed\n3. **Approve** (releases in SAP) or **Reject approval** (keeps order, clears pending)\n4. On detail you can also **Cancel order** (cancels SO in SAP)\n5. You can also browse orders / KPIs anytime",
          "wrap": true,
          "spacing": "Small"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Admin flow",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "1. **List users** → Manage to set Role / SalesOrg (confirm card)\n2. **View audit log** for who did what\n3. Force release / force cancel only for emergencies",
          "wrap": true,
          "spacing": "Small"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Shortcuts",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "ActionSet",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Recent orders", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Recent orders", "text": "recent orders" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "My Orders", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "My Orders", "text": "show my sales orders" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Revenue KPI", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Revenue KPI", "text": "show revenue kpi" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Request release", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Request release", "text": "request release" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Create order", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Create order", "text": "create order" } } }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}",
      "selectAction": {
        "type": "Action.ToggleVisibility",
        "targetElements": [
          "examples-en-employee",
          "examples-vi-employee",
          "examples-chevron-en-employee",
          "examples-chevron-vi-employee"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "ColumnSet",
          "columns": [
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "auto",
              "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "id": "examples-chevron-en-employee",
                  "text": "▸",
                  "weight": "Bolder",
                  "size": "Medium"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "text": "Try saying (EN) / Ví dụ lệnh (VI) — Employee",
                  "weight": "Bolder",
                  "wrap": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "id": "examples-en-employee",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "isVisible": false,
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Try saying (EN)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "size": "Small",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "ColumnSet",
          "columns": [
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "text": "• recent orders\n• show my sales orders\n• show open orders\n• show orders of TV01\n• show open orders of FU24\n• show order 13122\n• show overdue orders\n• create order (up to 5 materials)\n• edit order 13122\n• update reference 13122 to 'PO-99'\n• show revenue kpi\n• kpi by customer 1000\n• kpi by product MAT-01\n• request release 13122\n• reject order 13122\n• cancel order 13122\n• forward order 13122 to DEV-xxx\n• help · logout",
                  "wrap": true,
                  "fontType": "Monospace",
                  "size": "Small"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "id": "examples-vi-employee",
                  "text": "• đơn hàng gần đây\n• đơn của tôi\n• kiểm tra đơn 13122\n• sửa đơn 13122\n• cập nhật reference 13122 thành 'PO-99'\n• hủy đơn 13122\n• chuyển đơn 13122 cho DEV-xxx\n• yêu cầu duyệt 13122\n• hướng dẫn · đăng xuất",
                  "wrap": true,
                  "fontType": "Monospace",
                  "size": "Small"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Commands for Manager",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "ActionSet",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Pending approvals", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Pending approvals", "text": "show pending approvals" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Approve order", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Approve order", "text": "approve order" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Reject approval", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Reject approval", "text": "reject approval" } } }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}",
      "selectAction": {
        "type": "Action.ToggleVisibility",
        "targetElements": [
          "examples-en-manager",
          "examples-vi-manager",
          "examples-chevron-en-manager",
          "examples-chevron-vi-manager"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "ColumnSet",
          "columns": [
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "auto",
              "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "id": "examples-chevron-en-manager",
                  "text": "▸",
                  "weight": "Bolder",
                  "size": "Medium"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "text": "Try saying (EN) / Ví dụ lệnh (VI) — Manager",
                  "weight": "Bolder",
                  "wrap": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "id": "examples-en-manager",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "isVisible": false,
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Try saying (EN) · Ví dụ lệnh (VI)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "size": "Small",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "ColumnSet",
          "columns": [
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "text": "• show pending approvals\n• approve order 13122\n• reject approval 13122\n• show order 13122\n• cancel order 13122\n• show revenue kpi\n• logout",
                  "wrap": true,
                  "fontType": "Monospace",
                  "size": "Small"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "id": "examples-vi-manager",
                  "text": "• chờ duyệt · danh sách chờ duyệt\n• phê duyệt đơn 13122 · duyệt đơn 13122\n• từ chối duyệt 13122 · không duyệt 13122\n• hủy đơn 13122 · kiểm tra đơn 13122\n• đăng xuất",
                  "wrap": true,
                  "fontType": "Monospace",
                  "size": "Small"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Shortcuts",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "ActionSet",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "List users", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "List users", "text": "list users" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "View audit log", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "View audit log", "text": "view audit log" } } },
        { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Force release", "data": { "msteams": { "type": "messageBack", "displayText": "Force release", "text": "force release" } } }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}",
      "selectAction": {
        "type": "Action.ToggleVisibility",
        "targetElements": [
          "examples-en-admin",
          "examples-vi-admin",
          "examples-chevron-en-admin",
          "examples-chevron-vi-admin"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "ColumnSet",
          "columns": [
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "auto",
              "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "id": "examples-chevron-en-admin",
                  "text": "▸",
                  "weight": "Bolder",
                  "size": "Medium"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "text": "Try saying (EN) / Ví dụ lệnh (VI) — Admin",
                  "weight": "Bolder",
                  "wrap": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "id": "examples-en-admin",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "isVisible": false,
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Try saying (EN) · Ví dụ lệnh (VI)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "size": "Small",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "ColumnSet",
          "columns": [
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "text": "• list users\n• manage user DEV-xxx\n• view audit log\n• force release 13122\n• force cancel 13122\n• logout",
                  "wrap": true,
                  "fontType": "Monospace",
                  "size": "Small"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "Column",
              "width": "stretch",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "TextBlock",
                  "id": "examples-vi-admin",
                  "text": "• danh sách user\n• nhật ký audit\n• ép release 13122\n• ép hủy 13122\n• đăng xuất",
                  "wrap": true,
                  "fontType": "Monospace",
                  "size": "Small"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Tip: Prefer one language per message. Card buttons stay in English. Vietnamese like hướng dẫn / trợ giúp also opens this card.",
      "wrap": true,
      "isSubtle": true,
      "size": "Small",
      "spacing": "Large"
    }
  ]
}
